//! VM layer — PRODUCTION CANDIDATE `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-payment-hd.sil`
//! (contract `PolicyVaultRootedTokenHD`, generated by
//! `tools/gen_v7_payment_hd.js` as an exact-match delta over the CANDIDATE
//! `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-payment.sil`) driven through the real
//! TxScriptEngine (covenants enabled, real Schnorr), together with the
//! PRODUCTION root `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-root.sil`.
//!
//! Wave 2 Track D, gate I1
//! (docs/postlaunch/hierarchical-delegation-design-freeze.md §4): the honest
//! HD lifecycle at every proven level composed with the rooted vault
//! architecture, the owner's REQUIRED hostile list as real-engine refusals,
//! MAX_STACK_SIZE headroom measurement (padding method) deciding the MAXIMUM
//! PROVEN ROOTED LEVEL, and redeem/mass/sig-ops measurement.
//!
//! `contracts/experiments/HDProbe.sil` and `tests/vm/tests/hd_experiment.rs`
//! (the probe this candidate productionizes) are read-only reference points
//! for this file's tree/proof machinery and are never modified.
//! `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.5.sil` and `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-payment.sil`
//! are opened READ-ONLY as domain-separation / cross-family comparison
//! baselines and are never modified.

